  "interpretation": [
    "Removing the legacy dependency cuts the runtime closure by about two thirds",
    "The local median first-UI improvement is about 20 ms across three alternating samples per variant; this is not a statistically controlled benchmark",
    "Measured median process RSS falls by about 21 MiB on the same adapter",
    "Device and egui initialization remains the largest measured pre-frame interval; CAD viewport pipelines account for a smaller interval",
    "Current instrumentation groups device creation, surface setup and egui renderer setup; it does not identify which alone is responsible",
    "Startup targets remain unmet; native desktop/compositor presentation has not been measured"
  ],
